sentences.text:
The aforesaid Interlocutory Application has been Patna High Court CWJC No.11006 of 2019(7) dt.08-04-2024 preferred for substituting the name of heirs of of those who died as follows:
(i) Sri Satya Narayan Singh, (petitioner no.7) 3.8.2020;
(ii) Yasoda Devi, (petitioner no.8) 30.3.2022;
(iii) Ram Pravesh Singh, (petitioner no.22) 28.10.2021;
(iv) Rameshwar Singh, (petitioner no.24) 22.6.2020;
(v) Vinod @ Binod Singh, (petitioner no.25,) 8.12.2020.
2.

This writ petition has been preferred by the petitioner for the following reliefs:
(i) that the order dated 30.7.2017 passed in case no. 22/2016-17 contained in annexure-9 may be quashed;
(ii) that the respondents may be directed to make payment of compensation amount after treating the land of the petitioners as commercial land in terms of section 26(2)
of the New Land Acquisition Act, 2013;
Dineshwar Singh vs The State Of Bihar.

